# 🦠 COVID-19 Data Analysis & Visualization  

## 📌 Project Overview  
This project focuses on analyzing the global **COVID-19 pandemic** using **SQL (SQLite)** for data cleaning & querying and **Power BI** for visualization.  
The project demonstrates how raw COVID-19 data can be transformed into meaningful insights, covering **cases, deaths, vaccinations, and government policies**.  

The workflow includes:  
1. Importing raw datasets.  
2. Cleaning and normalizing data.  
3. Designing SQL queries and views for analysis.  
4. Creating interactive dashboards in Power BI.  
5. Preparing a project report with findings.  

